{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Yeah? Why?": "",
  "I've heard nothing but bad things, is all. Apparently he really strongarms his sellers. Puts the yakuza to shame, even.": "",
  "Yeah, man. Intimidation, harassment... He plays dirty.": "",
  "Even had one of their \"acquisition\" guys come around here. Felt like talking to a yakuza.": "",
  "Oh man...": "",
  "So Kaito-san's really teaming up with that guy? He gonna be all right?": "",
  "I wonder. I better have a talk with him.": "",
  "Hey, Kamaguchi-san. Can I ask you something?": "",
  "I'm at Adachi's office. What's up?": "",
  "You heard anything about Adachi Estates? There's some rumors going around about them.": "",
  "Yeah? Guess I'll wait for you here then.": "",
  "So, Tak. What's all this about?": "",
  "It's about Adachi-san, actually. Where is he?": "",
  "He went to dinner at Kanrai, and I'm meeting him there later. Why, you want him to hear this?": "",
  "No, I think it's better that he's gone, actually.": "",
  "I've heard some concerning stuff about Adachi-san, so I just wanted to make sure you knew.": "",
  "What do you mean, \"concerning\"?": "",
  "I wasn't out digging up dirt or anything, but people have been saying Adachi's company does dirty business.": "",
  "They'll go as far to say he makes the yakuza look friendly. I just want you to be careful.": "",
  "You came all the way over here just to tell me that, Tak?": "",
  "Something like that. Better safe than sorry.": "",
  "Then you wasted your time. I've known this guy longer than I've known you.": "",
  "The world can say whatever it wants, but I know when to trust my instincts. It's my call.": "",
  "You're right, but still...": "",
  "I don't need you sticking your nose into everything I do. Don't you have your own shit to deal with?": "",
  "...Right. I'll mind my own business then.": "",
  "Yeah, and don't worry about me so much. See ya around.": "",
  "(Kaito-san has a point, but that doesn't change how worried I am.)": "",
  "(Adachi is having dinner at Kanrai... Maybe I should just... check on him?)": "",
  "(There he is. I've gotta say, his associate looks pretty rough.)": "",
  "(Maybe I can get close enough to hear them without them noticing.)": "",
  "(I'll just listen for now.)": "",
  "I want that land, and I don't care what you have to do to get it. You keep the Ushimata Family out of this, got it?": "",
  "You doubt me? I've been beefing up security, you know. I've even hired Kaito.": "",
  "He's built like a tank and dumb as rocks. I assure you, I'm making every effort to crush them.": "",
  "The real problem is that the landlord is probably going to be stubborn...": "",
  "I have a contingency in place already. Take a look.": "",
  "A girl? She's cute, but what's this have to do with it?": "",
  "She's the landlord's daughter. Fresh into her first year of college.": "",
  "Moved out on her own and everything. I've already got her address.": "",
  "I don't follow...": "",
  "Let's just say I've got some thirsty boys ready to go. And a picture is worth a thousand words in a negotiation.": "",
  "Nobody wants his daughter's stolen virtue going viral. I'm sure he'll see things our way.": "",
  "Hahaha... Holy shit, Adachi. You really do put the yakuza to shame.": "",
  "Anyway, let's wrap this up. I'm meeting Kaito in a few, and this is higher level than he needs to hear.": "",
  "Right. You've got our future in your hands. Handle it.": "",
  "(Adachi is a monster... And Kaito is falling for this?)": "",
  "Kaito-san... You got a minute?": "",
  "What is it this time, Tak?": "",
  "Yo, Kaito. I didn't keep you waiting, did I?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Perfect timing. I think we need to put some things out on the table.": "",
  "Tak. What's all this about?": "",
  "The rumors about Adachi-san were true, Kaito-san. This guy is scum.": "",
  "Didn't I tell you to drop this shit, Tak?": "",
  "You did, but that's because you two have history. But whatever happened between then and now, he's not the same.": "",
  "Yagami-san, what are you talking about?": "",
  "Don't play dumb. I heard your whole conversation in Kanrai.": "",
  "You've got your eyes on some land, and you're sick enough to have your thugs hurt the owner's daughter to get it.": "",
  "Not only that, but you'd film a sexual assault and then use it as your bargaining chip. I think I heard enough.": "",
  "Wow, that's... dark. Maybe you misunderstood something?": "",
  "No, I wouldn't call it that at all. Even Kaito-san is just a tool in your scheme.": "",
  "Well, this is pretty unsettling, isn't it? I think Yagami-san might have the wrong idea, here.": "",
  "But Kaito... You know what kind of guy I am, don't you?": "",
  "You think I'm capable of the horrible things he's saying about me?": "",
  "Kaito, trust me. Come with me, and I'll prove it.": "",
  "I signed on for the job. I'm not going to go back on my word.": "",
  "Your word, Kaito-san!?": "",
  "Sorry, Tak. But I told you to stay out of this. Anything from here on is my problem to deal with.": "",
  "That's how it is, huh?": "",
  "Are we done here? We need to get going, Kaito.": "",
  "He's using you, Kaito-san. I won't let him drag you down with him.": "",
  "Did you hear a word I said, Tak? I told you to butt out.": "",
  "Hell no. I know the truth now, and I can't just turn a blind eye.": "",
  "And I'm telling you, I don't need your help.": "",
  "Come on, Kaito-san!": "",
  "So you're willing to do what it takes to stop me?": "",
  "Yeah. I'll kick your ass if I have to.": "",
  "I wouldn't recommend trying. When was the last time you beat me in a fight? Never?": "",
  "Right. The old me never stood a chance against you. But this time...": "",
  "I think I'm fighting for something bigger. And I won't lose.": "",
  "Heh. Fine. You can talk big, at least.": "",
  "But if you're gonna block my way, I'm going to go through you. And that's gonna hurt.": "",
  "Let's see you try. I'm going to wake your ass up, one way or another!": "",
  "I'm not holding back, Tak!": "",
  "Haa... Ha... When'd you learn how to punch, Tak?": "",
  "Ha... Guess I picked it up somewhere along the way. Did getting your ass beat bring you to your senses?": "",
  "Haa... Ha... I coulda done without it, ya moron. I've been seeing straight this whole time.": "",
  "You still don't get it, Kaito-san!? What's it going to take!?": "",
  "I'm out of ways to communicate to you, man! Why won't you trust me!?": "",
  "I didn't even want to fight you...": "",
  "Tak, listen...": "",
  "Seriously, Kaito. Enough dicking around. You can't do guard duty if you're bruised and beaten.": "",
  "My bad, Adachi. But it looks like I can't go with you.": "",
  "This stubborn sonuvabitch isn't going to let me through.": "",
  "You want me to come along, you owe it to Tak to prove your innocence, right here and now.": "",
  "Innocence? What, so now I'm guilty of something?": "",
  "You don't believe me?": "",
  "Can't say that I do, actually.": "",
  "You've said a lot of shit that hasn't sat right with me since we met back up.": "",
  "L-Like what?": "",
  "C'mon man, we went drinking a bunch of times. You've said all kinds of shady stuff.": "",
  "I didn't need Tak to point out just how much you've changed.": "",
  "You suspected him the whole time, Kaito-san? Then why did you...": "",
  "I still woulda liked to have seen it with my own eyes, Tak.": "",
  "And if he was going to pull some ill shit with me around, you bet your ass I'd have kicked his to stop it.": "",
  "I thought maybe I could bring him around...": "",
  "What the hell? You coulda just said that...": "",
  "I tried to tell you it was my problem, man. But no, you had to go poking your nose into it.": "",
  "...So, Adachi. Let's hear it.": "",
  "You have anything that would contradict Tak's account?": "",
  "Feh. I see how it is. Thank god for friends, right?": "",
  "And here you were trying to save me... Brings a tear to my eye.": "",
  "I'll take that as a no, Adachi?": "",
  "You know what, Kaito? You're a pain in the ass! You've never known your damn place!": "",
  "An idiot like you should just follow orders, not think!": "",
  "I've got some work for you, boys!": "",
  "You both know too much. Now I've got no choice.": "",
  "What's the plan, Kaito-san?": "",
  "I can't believe I let this guy sucker me like that...": "",
  "This is no time to mope, Kaito-san. We can settle this together if you want, though.": "",
  "Yeah. Sorry, but I might need your help here.": "",
  "Cool. Time for the usual mayhem, then.": "",
  "It was fun while it lasted, Kaito! But what can I say? You're poison to any partnership!": "",
  "H-Hey, come on, Kaito! Let's reconsider! I'm gonna come into a nice stack of cash real soon!": "",
  "I'll cut you in! We're friends, aren't we!? We could still be partners!": "",
  "Gwrugh!": "",
  "Get outta my sight, Adachi. If I ever see your face again, I'm gonna pound it.": "",
  "K-Kaito...": "",
  "You sure it was wise to let him loose, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Yeah. Nobody's gonna save him from the weight of his own deeds.": "",
  "As for me... Not sure why I went looking for a new partner when I've already got one.": "",
  "Hm? Partners, eh?": "",
  "Tak... When it's all said and done, I owe you more than anyone.": "",
  "So don't let me down.": "",
  "I won't, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Wanna get cheesy?": "",
  "Hahaha. Hell no.": "",
  "Hahaha. Guess it's not really our style.": "",
  "Damn. Too much ass kicking for one night. I'm gonna go crash. Later.": "",
  "(It's good to have you around, Kaito-san.)": "",
  "Hm? Aren't you...?": "",
  "(Crap, Adachi-san knows my face! He'll be on guard if I get too close.)": "",
  "(What can I do, though?)": "",
  "(Kaito-san is on his way to Kanrai. I need to talk to him about this.)": "",
  "Ah, no problem.": "",
  "In fact, we were about to go grab a beer together. Wanna tag along, Tak?": "",
  "About that...": "",
  "I need a bodyguard.": "",
  "Yeah, you wouldn't think real estate would have such physical demands...": "",
  "But Kamurocho's market has been attracting rough types for years, and they hate newcomers like me.": "",
  "When you say rough types... You mean yakuza?": "",
  "...Yeah. It's a never-ending cycle of fights, protection money, and scare tactics.": "",
  "And that's why you need a bodyguard?": "",
  "Yes, but, only if it wouldn't cause any trouble for you. I know you must be drowning in cases.": "",
  "Not really. I understand, though, and I'm fine with it, as long as Kaito-san is.": "",
  "Yeah, no prob. But I'm not givin' you any friendly discounts, Adachi.": "",
  "Of course. How does 80k per day sound to you, Yagami-san?": "",
  "No issue here.": "",
  "Incredible. I really appreciate how flexible you've been about this!": "",
  "And Kaito, it looks like our little tag team rides again, eh?": "",
  "I'm looking forward to this... partner.": "",
  "Heh, this sure brings me back. Glad to be aboard.": "",
  "(Nice. Kaito-san seems to really be enjoying having found his old buddy.)": "",
  "(Hayato Adachi, huh?)": "",
  "(I should have his company's business card in my case file, and that'll give me his address. Maybe I should check in on him.)": "",
  "(Maybe if I hit some spots where the locals gather I could pick something up.)": "",
  "Hm? What's up?": "",
  "Ooh, yeah, I've heard of them. And I suggest you don't get involved.": "",
  "Why's that?": "",
  "Well, the way I hear it, they make the yakuza look like the good guys.": "",
  "Yeah? That's damning.": "",
  "Right? They use threats, tricks... They'll sink to any low to get the job done.": "",
  "And Adachi himself is the worst of the pack. He puts on a good show, but he's downright evil.": "",
  "...Not that I've seen it firsthand or anything. Hope that helps.": "",
  "Yeah, it does. Thanks.": "",
  "(It could be just rumors... But I should still let Kaito-san know about them, just in case.)": "",
  "Hey, I've got a quick question for you guys.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! What can I do for you?": "",
  "You ever heard the name, Adachi Estate?": "",
  "Any customers name drop them, maybe?": "",
  "Hm, no, can't say that I have.": "",
  "Actually, it does ring a bell.": "",
  "Mmhm. I had a customer in finance come through the other day.": "",
  "He was talking about having a lot of clients taking out loans because of some Adachi guy bothering them.": "",
  "That's what I was afraid of. Anything else?": "",
  "He just told us to watch out for that guy. He said the type of bribes he'd use would make a yakuza go pale.": "",
  "Oh, you mean that evil real estate agent? One of my friends told me about him!": "",
  "I think his name was Adachi!": "",
  "I see. You've been a huge help, so thank you.": "",
  "Hello, Kaito-san? Where are you right now?": "",
  "Just something I wanted to tell you about. I'll head your direction.": "",
  "That's why I took the bodyguard job. I figured I'd be close enough to see it.": "",
  "How are you, Kawada-san?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. Apologies for calling you all the way out here.": "",
  "Don't worry. So how's that novel you won selling?": "",
  "Actually... We haven't been able to publish it yet.": "",
  "Huh? Why not? I thought you said this one would fly off the shelves.": "",
  "Yes, but we have to publish it first, and we've hit a snag in that department.": "",
  "I read the book, and I can't help but feel that... it's incomplete.": "",
  "My point is, I think he's going to write a sequel.": "",
  "But wouldn't he have told you something about it if he was?": "",
  "Well, he should have, but he didn't.": "",
  "Either way, I can't publish this without whatever's coming next.": "",
  "And just as I suspected, Katagiri-sensei is already talking about his next work. It's gotta be the sequel.": "",
  "I guess that's plausible.": "",
  "Wait. Don't tell me that's why you reached out to me...": "",
  "Very sharp, Yagami-san! It's another event with another problem to solve!": "",
  "Oh. Great.": "",
  "I need you with me on this, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'll pay you even more than last time! 210,000 yen! How does that sound?": "",
  "Fine, if I can do it... I don't know if I can, but I suppose I'll give it my best shot.": "",
  "That's all I could ask! Thank you very much!": "",
  "Then let's head over! Are you ready, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Then let's head over.": "",
  "They've got the same venue, I see.": "",
  "Why change what's working, you know?": "",
  "Honored guests, thank you all for attending the next event for Katagiri-sensei's latest book announcement.": "",
  "First, a few words from the legend himself. The stage is yours, Katagiri-sensei!": "",
  "Thank you all for coming yet again.": "",
  "As you know, I awarded my last book to a publisher who could solve the problem I presented last time.": "",
  "I'm pleased that this gave me the opportunity to work with a publisher I'd never have considered otherwise.": "",
  "In fact, this was so inspiring, I've managed to complete my next book ahead of schedule.": "",
  "And considering how well it worked, I would like to award it to a publisher who can solve my next riddle.": "",
  "Do your best everyone. And thank you.": "",
  "Okay, Yagami-san! Get those juices flowing!": "",
  "We're ready to announce the problem, everyone! But first, the rules!": "",
  "Just as before, the problem's solution will be a code that can be entered in this safe.": "",
  "Inside, you'll find the master script to Katagiri-sensei's new book.": "",
  "If you feel like you have the solution, just come up to the stage and try your luck.": "",
  "If the safe opens, then congratulations! You've won the rights to publish the novel.": "",
  "Now, if everyone's ready... Here's the problem!": "",
  "Another doozy... What are your thoughts, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I just need to think a sec...": "",
  "(These are multiplication problems... There must be a pattern among the answers.)": "",
  "(Oh. Maybe...)": "",
  "I think I've got it, Kawada-san.": "",
  "Do you!? That's the Yagami-san I know! Then head up there and enter the code!": "",
  "Wow! It seems Yagami-san from Cloudy Skies Publishing has once again arrived at the solution!": "",
  "Yagami-san! How are you feeling about this one?": "",
  "Well... Pretty good, I guess.": "",
  "This sounds promising! Give it a shot!": "",
  "(All right, time to enter the code.)": "",
  "(I should check the problem once more.)": "",
  "(There must be a pattern to these multiplication answers...)": "",
  "(All right.)": "",
  "Oh no! The safe won't open! That's a shame!": "",
  "(Tch... I'm wrong. What did I miss?)": "",
  "Don't get discouraged, Yagami-san! I think you can still do this!": "",
  "Yeah, yeah, I know.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Yeah? Why?": "อ้อ? เพราะอะไรล่ะ?",
  "Oh man...": "โอ้โห...",
  "I don't follow...": "ผมตามไม่ทันครับ...",
  "About that...": "เรื่องนั้นนะ...",
  "Hm? What's up?": "หืม? มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "Why's that?": "ทำไมล่ะ?"
 }
}
